OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry but rather cloudy at first,
OL,6,Fwith winds gradually strengthening
OL,7,Fthrough the morning. Cloud will
OL,8,Fthicken further into the afternoon,
OL,9,Fbringing outbreaks of rain,
OL,10,Foccasionally heavy but generally light
OL,11,Ffor many, before clearing eastwards by
OL,12,Fearly evening.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FAny remaining rain will soon
OL,15,Fclear, leaving a dry and mostly clear
OL,16,Fnight with light winds. It will turn
OL,17,Fchilly, with fog patches and grass
OL,18,Ffrost likely in rural areas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
