OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FAny fog will soon clear to
OL,6,Fleave a fine day with light winds and
OL,7,Flong sunny periods, perhaps hazy at
OL,8,Ftimes. Feeling pleasantly warm in the
OL,9,Fafternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FBreezy
OL,12,Fand rather cloudy on Tuesday. Heavy
OL,13,Frain followed by a few showers on
OL,14,FWednesday. Dry with sunny spells on
OL,15,FThursday. Above average daytime
OL,16,Ftemperatures though cooler by Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
